{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_018AkyW7rFXXQLBwn4rdx2oh","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_011ceVzkVhkhGMkhqcPb9rgt","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 -c \"\ns=open('TODO.md').read(); s=s.replace('- [ ] **sos_257','- [x] **sos_257'); open('TODO.md','w').write(s)\"\necho '- **sos_257 / engine**: Restricted mana = single-restriction model in `ManaPool` (`add_restricted`, `for_spell=` kwarg on `can_pay`/`pay`); only \"spend only on instant/sorcery\" is supported (deliberate limitation). Restricted mana is consumed first when eligible.\n- **sos_257**: Animation done via a permanent `ContinuousEffect` + in-place mutation (survives the cleanup reset); `power`/`toughness` raise `AttributeError` until animated so the zero-toughness SBA does not destroy the plain land — caught by a smoke check, not the test suite.' >> KEY_DECISIONS.md\ngit add -A && git commit -q -m \"sos_257: Great Hall of the Biblioplex\"\ncat /workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/card_spec.json","description":"Commit sos_257, read sos_57 spec"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":969,"cache_read_input_tokens":184326,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":969},"output_tokens":60,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"893a3734-c286-42f5-aefd-da95fae8f9f9","uuid":"55c3984a-0c07-4fd9-b078-ac820662e33e","request_id":"req_011CbwDWmHgCAtX2aMJLFrTD"}
