{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01T8trFeTauCccnFTE1pdREj","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01D9NfCjmLNtCfTcaa2JPbEd","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"python3 - <<'EOF'\n# Throwaway smoke: Swords on empty board fizzles (copy not castable, stays prepared);\n# token \"1/1 white and black\": colors not modeled — check P/T+flying+subtype only.\nfrom cards.sos.sos_13.card_impl import EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares\nfrom engine.abilities import ActivatedAbilityInstance, activate_ability\nfrom engine.card import Creature\nfrom engine.stack import priority_loop\nfrom engine.types import ManaType\nfrom test_utils import cast_spell, create_game, set_board_state\n\ngame = create_game(scripts=([], []))\np1, p2 = game.players\nset_board_state(game, 1, battlefield=[Creature(name=\"B1\", base_power=2, base_toughness=2),\n                                      Creature(name=\"B2\", base_power=2, base_toughness=2)])\nem = EmeritusOfTruceSwordsToPlowshares()\nset_board_state(game, 0, hand=[em], mana={ManaType.WHITE: 2, ManaType.COLORLESS: 1})\ncast_spell(game, 0, \"Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\", targets=[p2])\nassert em.is_prepared\n# wipe all creatures except... actually empty both battlefields entirely\nset_board_state(game, 1, battlefield=[])\nset_board_state(game, 0, battlefield=[])  # board now has no creature at all\nset_board_state(game, 0, mana={ManaType.WHITE: 1})\naa = em.get_activated_abilities()[0]\np1._script.extend([\"pass\"]); p2._script.extend([\"pass\"])\nactivate_ability(game, p1, ActivatedAbilityInstance(source=em, controller=p1, cost=aa.cost, effect=aa.effect))\npriority_loop(game)\n# can_cast False (no creature anywhere) -> CastingError -> copy removed, still prepared\nassert em.is_prepared\nassert all(c.name != \"Swords to Plowshares\" for c in game.get_exile(p1).get_all())\nprint(\"smoke OK: no legal target -> copy not cast, stays prepared\")\nEOF\npython3 -c \"\ns=open('TODO.md').read(); s=s.replace('- [ ] **sos_13','- [x] **sos_13'); open('TODO.md','w').write(s)\"\necho '- **sos_13**: Engine fires the ETB event *before* `register_triggers` (a staged engine test encodes this), so self-ETB cannot use `register_triggers` alone — the ETB trigger is registered in `on_cast` instead, with a duplicate guard in `register_triggers` for non-cast entries. (Tried reordering the engine hooks per CR 603.6a; it regressed `engine_tests`, so reverted.)\n- **sos_13**: Per CR 722.3c the prepared copy is cast *paying* its {W} cost (not free); exposed as an activated ability since the engine has no other entry point for casting from exile. The copy is created lazily at cast time; token colors (white/black) are not modeled by the engine.' >> KEY_DECISIONS.md\ngit add -A && git commit -q -m \"sos_13: Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares\" && echo committed","description":"Smoke, log, commit sos_13"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2528,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1202,"cache_read_input_tokens":239417,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1202},"output_tokens":57,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"893a3734-c286-42f5-aefd-da95fae8f9f9","uuid":"368283b7-0a0a-4c5d-a1bf-4722c9449e66","request_id":"req_011CbwEQTDS7RdppynGHrUVE"}
