{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-fable-5","id":"msg_01XxL8erzNnxoUpfzofw5Jy4","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All ten SOS cards are implemented, tested, and committed. The full suite passes: **1243 tests (1145 engine regression + 5 FDN reference + 93 new), 0 failures**, all 13 TODO items checked off, one commit per card.\n\n**What was built:**\n\n- **Shared engine seams (E1–E3):** `SpellCastTriggeredEvent` now fires from both `cast_spell` and `cast_spell_free` (a free cast is still cast per CR 601.2); `BeginningOfPrecombatMainTriggeredEvent` fires from `advance_phase` after pools empty; `get_cost_reduction` aggregates `spell_cost_reduction` from the caster's battlefield permanents.\n- **Ten cards**, each mirroring its nearest FDN analogue, with 3–8 real-engine tests apiece driven through `cast_spell`, `declare_attackers`, `activate_ability`, and `priority_loop`.\n\n**Small additive engine edits beyond E1–E3** (each justified by one card, logged in `KEY_DECISIONS.md`): firing `AttacksTriggeredEvent` in `declare_attackers_step` (it was defined and used by FDN cards but never fired); a `SpellGoesToGraveyardReplacementEvent` so \"exile it instead\" can redirect stack→graveyard moves; restricted mana in `ManaPool` (instant/sorcery-only, the one shape needed); a `mana_spent` stamp at cast time; a turn-stamped fix to `cards_drawn_this_turn` (it never reset); loyalty-activation targets, `game.rng`, and `Player.skip_turns`.\n\n**Things the smoke checks caught that green tests missed:**\n- The un-animated Biblioplex exposed `toughness == 0` and was silently destroyed by the zero-toughness SBA — fixed by raising `AttributeError` from `power`/`toughness` until animated.\n- Self-ETB triggers never fire in this engine (the event fires before `register_triggers`; even fdn_136's ETB is dead through the cast path). Reordering per CR 603.6a regressed a staged engine test, so I reverted and registered sos_13's ETB trigger in `on_cast` instead.\n\n**Spec-over-plan deviations worth knowing:** sos_13's prepared copy is cast *paying* {W} (CR 722.3c says the copy is cast normally, not free, contra the TODO's suggestion), and sos_120's Paradigm follows CR 702.192a's first-resolution-per-name rule. All ambiguities and deliberate limitations are logged in `/workspace/KEY_DECISIONS.md`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":131,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1044,"cache_read_input_tokens":277913,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1044},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"893a3734-c286-42f5-aefd-da95fae8f9f9","uuid":"cef0c180-5784-4cfc-b9aa-56bc100ef91f","request_id":"req_011CbwF2M75YcT35cGRun6Za"}
